- input:
    content: "if (true) then print(\"true\")\nif (false) then print(\"true\") else print(\"true\")\nprint(\"was\")\nif (false) then\n\tprint(false)\nelse\n\tprint(true)\nend if\nif (false) then\n\tprint(false)\nelse\n\tprint(true)\n\tif (false) then print(\"true\") else print(\"true\")\nend if\n\nfor i in [] print(i)\nfor b in []\n\tprint(b)\nend for\nwhile (i < b) i += 1\nwhile (b < i)\n\tb += 1\nend while\nmyFunction = function(v)\n  print(v)\nend function\notherFunction = function(n)\n\tprint(n)\nend function\n\nif not @ref then\nend if\n\nif true then\n\telseSomething = false\nelse\nend if\n\nfor c in clist //x\n\tprint(\"moo\")\nend for\n\nwhile true //x\n\tprint(\"moo\")\nend while\n\nif true then //x\n\tprint(\"moo\")\nend if\n\nif x < 0 then return else print x\nif true and true then item = function()\n    print \"hello\"\nend function"
